# The credential exit's relay and authority, vendored from the proxy
# (sessions/credential_exit.py over _vendored/exit_relay.py and
# _vendored/exit_authority.py), installed best effort after
# requirements.txt by the installers, the update, the bare-metal setup and,
# on a paired computer that lacks them, the satellite itself at boot:
# a host with no cryptography wheel (32-bit ARM outside piwheels, say) still
# installs and updates, runs no exit, and its sessions leave out every tool
# that needs a key, since the machine rule reads it as having no listener.
# Compiled against the main lock (-c requirements.txt), so a package both
# need is pinned the same. The proxy's own pins as floors, so the two venvs
# never hold an older one than the platform.
